WEBVTT

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:50.460
Kagutsu...

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:52.880
What have you done?

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:04.520
Is there anyone alive out there?!

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:09.900
Someone... anyone?!

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:20.870
Please... someone answer me!

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:44.180
Hey! Wake up!

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:45.060
Are you okay?!

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:49.230
I'm too late...

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:51.270
He was just a little kid!

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:57.320
Is this the end result of the ideals I've pursued?

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:02.910
What use is a king's power
if I can't even save one child?!

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:34.230
What do you make of this, Fushimi-san?

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:37.190
How can there be another Sword of Damocles?

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:41.070
I thought there were only four Kings right now...

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:45.490
This can't be good...

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:50.330
What color is that anyway?

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:54.500
It's neither gold nor colorless.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.300
So there's only one left...

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:59.670
Although I never thought it was possible.

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:02.930
The Green King's sword is fading!

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:06.800
The Fifth King's Weismann level
is dropping drastically!

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:23.700
14 years ago,

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:26.780
a King's death triggered
the worst destruction in human history.

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:28.950
It became known as the Kagutsu Incident...

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:33.410
And it was believed that amongst
those victims was the Sixth King,

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:36.960
the Gray King Ootori Seigo...

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:39.300
But as it turns out, not only did he survive,

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:42.970
but he was also the Green Clan's true mastermind.

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:47.550
I must admit, I'm quite surprised.

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:49.970
You're wrong, Munakata.

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:54.850
The man you call Ootori Seigo
did indeed die that day.

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:57.060
The man you're looking at now,

00:04:57.060 --> 00:05:00.730
the surrogate father of the Green King Hisui Nagare

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:03.900
and a freeloader of JUNGLE,
Iwafune Tenkei.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:05.990
A chicken that can't fly.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:08.990
So stop making such a big deal over me.

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:10.870
I'm just a simple old man.

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:16.000
The Fog Sanctum has the property of ultimate defense.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:19.290
After demonstrating that power here,

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:23.090
you have the audacity to call yourself a simple man?

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:30.640
I win, Munakata Reisi.

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:38.400
Meow?!

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:41.230
It's starting to get all hazy.

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:42.400
What's going on?

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:44.280
No!

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:45.820
I have to stop him!

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:57.790
Anna!

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:14.720
Shiro! Shiro!

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:15.470
Shiro!

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:18.350
Kuro, take care of Neko!

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:19.480
Get away from there!

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:25.990
Shiro! Shiro!

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:29.990
Munakata-san...

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:53.050
Aw, c'mon.

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:54.850
What are you aiming at?

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:00.270
Taking cheap shots to win?

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:02.940
I suppose it's fitting for a cowardly man like you,

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:06.900
who changed his name and
went into hiding after losing his clan!

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:08.740
Say whatever you like.

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:11.570
It doesn't bother me one bit.

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:13.370
I stopped caring about my pride years ago.

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:17.330
The Gray Clan, CATHEDRAL...

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:23.960
It was a powerful clan whose influence, in its heyday, was second only to the Gold Clan, TOKIJIKUIN.

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:29.800
And the one who led CATHEDRAL
was the Gray King Ootori Seigo.

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:32.010
He was said to be a man
of great virtue and strength...

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:33.840
He was widely respected not just by his clansmen,

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:38.180
but also from ordinary civilians as well.

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:41.690
You're giving the guy way too much credit...

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:56.580
14 years ago, he led his clansmen to try and prevent
the Red King Kagutsu Genji's Damocles Down from happening.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:58.910
But he failed to stop Kagutsu.

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:00.830
And as a result, he lost all his clansmen.

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:07.590
That catastrophic event claimed over 700,000 lives, including ordinary civilians.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:11.550
So the man decided to leave
behind his old self in the past,

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:14.430
along with the memories of
the people he had failed to save.

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:16.140
Am I right?!

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:21.270
Who knows?

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:23.520
It's all ancient history now.

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:27.060
Then tell me why, after all this time,

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:31.490
you've conspired with Hisui Nagare
and decided to come out in the open!

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:35.410
If the world that Hisui Nagare
proposes should become a reality,

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:37.990
society will fall into chaos and, without a doubt,

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:40.160
multitudes of lives will be sacrificed.

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.580
I can't believe that endorsing
such barbarism is in line with

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:49.000
your past efforts to save the people
and create the ideal paradise.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:53.220
Has the Kagutsu Incident forced you to fall that low?

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:59.050
Ideal paradise, you say?

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:03.060
A king doesn't have the power
to create such a thing.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:07.100
We're all being played by the goddamn Slates...

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:09.060
That includes both you and I.

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:12.110
But not him...

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:14.070
He intends to play the Slates...

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:30.920
Anna!

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:31.960
Are you all right?

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:33.340
You're shivering...

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.300
This fog... it's so cold...

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:39.970
I can feel the weight of his despair...

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:42.600
The Gray King Ootori Seigo...

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:46.230
The Lieutenant once described him
as a pacifist who detested conflict.

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:47.900
But when forced to fight,

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:55.990
he would display strength rivaling that of the then
Blue King Habari Jin and Red King Kagutsu Genji.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:57.780
Munakata-san...

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:04.950
Oh no! The rooftop!

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:10.130
Hundreds of thousands of people
had to lose their lives that day...

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:13.710
All because they were helpless,
and didn't know what to do.

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:17.170
If each person has their own power,

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:20.430
at least they won't confront death helplessly.

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:23.100
They have the choice to fight back on their own.

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:27.600
That's the kind of world Nagare is trying to create.

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:29.100
Such nonsense!

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:33.110
Suddenly giving humans undeserved power

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:38.490
will only make them flaunt it, and they will end up
killing each other, and turn this into a depraved world.

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:42.620
Society needs order, and the people to oversee it.

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:44.990
A world where there is order and reason...

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:47.000
that is the ideal world, a beautiful world.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:50.580
Wow, you and your lofty ideals...

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:54.130
I guess that's why you're the Blue King...

00:10:54.670 --> 00:11:00.550
You believe in this nonsense about creating
the ideal world with your own power, Munakata...

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:05.600
because you're a kid
who's never experienced failure.

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:11.150
Or is the Blue King better than that?!

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:17.190
Whoops...

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:19.070
Time out...

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:23.490
Listen kid, you need to stop being so aggressive.

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:27.450
Here's some advice from an old man.

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:32.170
The higher your ideals,
the bigger your disappointments.

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:36.710
Moderation is everything, relax a little.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:39.470
I don't care to engage in idle talk!

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:44.260
Are we back to playing hide-and-seek?!

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:50.640
Well, don't think I'll make it easy for you.

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:52.230
Don't push yourself.

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:54.230
You look pretty worn out.

00:11:54.860 --> 00:11:59.030
I really don't like kicking people
when they're down, but...

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:01.450
I need to wrap things up.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:55.710
Sorry, Munakata!

00:12:56.130 --> 00:13:03.720
Playing swordfight with you was just
to buy time to haul this outta here.

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:07.720
Hey, thief!

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:09.850
Give it back!

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:12.980
They got us.

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:31.830
Get that monitor back online!

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:34.580
I need to know if the Captain's okay!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:35.960
Y-Yes, sir!

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:39.420
I'll send men to the Chamber of Slates immediately!

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:45.510
It pays to have insurance...

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:51.100
Evacuating the injured is top priority!

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:53.810
Are there any more injured inside the tower?

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:57.020
The interior could collapse.

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:59.440
Rescue teams are to exercise extreme caution.

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:02.190
Where's the helicopter now?

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:05.690
I'm afraid that fog not
only acts as a smokescreen...

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:09.280
It's also jamming our radars,
making it impossible to track them.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:10.530
I see.

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:12.910
Anyway, keep searching
with everything we've got.

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:13.950
Yes, ma'am!

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:19.370
I want the intel team to analyze the videos quickly!

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:21.210
Report all your findings to Fushimi!

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:30.720
Shiro...

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:32.220
Are you okay?

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:33.430
Shiro.

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:34.930
What should we do now?

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:42.020
That's a good question...

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:45.440
Honestly, I'm at a loss myself.

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:49.320
I didn't think for a moment that
they'd have a wild card like that.

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:53.830
I messed up...

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:56.580
Stop blaming yourself, Shiro.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.120
We don't have time for that.

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:02.420
We're going to take back the Slates, aren't we?

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:04.040
Take it back, huh?

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:11.720
The Lieutenant put his life on the line for over half a century to keep the Slates under control...

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:15.260
And after his death,
Munakata-san took over that task...

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:17.770
But now, it's only a matter of time

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:20.520
before the Slates' power is released to the world.

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:23.190
What'll happen if it's released?

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:25.320
Will everyone go naked?

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:26.440
Idiot!

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:28.280
We're having a serious discussion.

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:32.780
I'm just trying to cheer Shiro up!

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:36.700
Shiro-san, we're going to head out now.

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:38.870
Some of our boys need to get treated.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:40.250
Oh, sure.

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:41.790
Thank you for your help.

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:45.040
It's not over yet.

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:50.590
There <i>has</i> to be something we can still do.

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:53.050
We haven't given up.

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:55.010
Yes, you're right.

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:57.970
There are still ways...

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:04.980
Man...

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:07.900
We let ourselves get bossed
around by that Silver King...

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:10.190
And we still end up losing?

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:13.860
C'mon, San-chan...
Don't be so hard on the guy.

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:15.570
He's right.

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:19.750
It's on us too, for not being
able to stop the Green King.

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:22.210
So what happens now?

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:25.580
Well, since the Greens got hold of the Slates...

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:29.960
I don't know, what <i>is</i> supposed to happen, Yata-san?

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:37.470
Oh, hey...

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:38.720
What's up...

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:42.270
So we form this overblown alliance

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:45.850
and put on this act of
working together, only to lose.

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:47.650
Talk about ridiculous.

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:50.860
Quit talking shit, will ya!

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:53.110
We all did our best.

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:56.530
And our best effort ended like this?

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:59.910
You're one to talk when all you did was
sit in the car and hit keys on your keyboard!

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:02.660
Besides, none of this would've happened

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:05.040
if your king had beaten the Gray King!

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:12.460
You're absolutely right.

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:18.140
What a loser...

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:22.100
Hey, that's your king you're talking about!

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:25.100
Aren't you going to stand up for him?!

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:28.980
Hey...

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:32.360
Things are about to get interesting...

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:35.820
Try and keep up, if you can...

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:39.070
Saruhiko?

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:49.080
To think the Gray King was alive all along...

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.840
And the fact that he was working with Hisui

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:53.550
was completely unexpected

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:55.260
Completely unexpected?

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:57.180
I couldn't disagree more.

00:17:57.180 --> 00:17:59.090
It was a preventable mistake.

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:04.730
Neither you nor Isana Yashiro considered
the possibility of the Gray King being involved...

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:08.100
It's clear who's at fault here.

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:11.860
You kings were so fixated on the struggle for the Slates

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:15.110
that you didn't even sense the existence of another.

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:23.540
If you're just here to criticize what's
already happened, then leave...

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:25.620
I'm very tired.

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:29.250
Aren't you going to give us your next orders?

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:33.090
I'm sure Isana Yashiro will think of something.

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:35.630
Follow his orders.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:38.380
After all, I've been defeated.

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:40.640
I'll keep myself out of the way.

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:47.140
So you're just going to sulk... All because you got your ass kicked in a one-on-one fight?

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:52.230
You were probably thinking that
with the Gold King finally gone,

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:55.400
there was no one left to stand in your way.

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:59.320
You could control the world as you saw fit.

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:03.410
Only to find out an annoying old man still survived.

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.830
I'd be pissed too, if I were you.

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:11.420
You must be very pleased
with how this all turned out.

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:15.840
After all, you were against
this alliance from the start.

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:20.010
Are you glad that the plan had failed?

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:24.850
Oh yeah... as well as the fact that you lost!

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:27.640
Fushimi-san, that's going too far!

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:37.440
If you're bailing now, I'm resigning.

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:39.110
Fine, resign.

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:42.110
If you have complaints against me, leave now.

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:48.620
You're used to being a traitor anyway.

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:53.540
If you don't like something, you quit.

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:56.630
Isn't that the kind of person you've always been?

00:19:56.630 --> 00:20:00.170
That's why you could never
commit yourself to one king.

00:20:00.170 --> 00:20:04.050
But you also couldn't remove
yourself from the Slates' influence.

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:07.890
So you just wander around aimlessly in your small world.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:10.140
Pathetic...

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:26.410
Fushimi-san!

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:27.990
Captain, shouldn't we stop him?

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:31.750
Let him go.

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:40.920
Hi Seri-chan... What's up?

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:43.510
Are you calling to discuss about
our plans moving forward?

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:44.220
Huh?

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:45.510
Fushimi?

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:49.310
No, he's not here.

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:50.770
What about Fushimi?

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:56.980
Hey Yata... Have you been in contact with Fushimi?

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:59.020
Are you kidding me?

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:02.530
Did he do something?

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:04.860
Well...

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:07.030
Seems he walked out of SCEPTER 4

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:08.410
after getting into some kind of argument...

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:10.040
And hasn't been heard from since.

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:12.540
What?

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:17.920
He and the Captain exchanged
some harsh words...

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:24.670
To be honest, our work is stacking up.

00:21:24.670 --> 00:21:28.930
Most of us relied on Fushimi-kun's personal skills...

00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:34.430
Where can that boy be?

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:37.480
Does he even have a place to sleep?

00:23:33.600 --> 00:23:37.770
<i>You're used to being</i> <i>a traitor anyway.</i>

00:23:41.980 --> 00:23:44.940
Fine, then I'll become a traitor!

00:23:58.790 --> 00:24:01.080
The giant Green tree blossoms in full...

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:03.210
While a shard of Blue breaks away...

00:24:03.420 --> 00:24:06.000
Next time on <i>K: Return of Kings,</i>

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:08.460
#9 "Kid's room".

00:24:08.460 --> 00:24:11.590
Distorted hearts are lost and wander aimlessly.
